WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:12,400
I'll be traveling for 10 days soon and what are you about flying with the right

00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:20,300
machine? Is it typical okay to travel with? Yes, you should have no trouble

00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:27,380
traveling with it. You can carry it. It's carrying case. If you do that I would

00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:33,700
bring it as a carry on. Not I would not check it. But I put my right machine

00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:39,740
and wrapped it in a sweatshirt, put it in my baggage and checked my luggage, fell

00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:44,900
problem and I brought it in on my carry on. No trouble. I've never brought to

00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:51,760
big plastic case. I've always to conserve space, wrapped it in a sweatshirt or

00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:58,420
something like that and put it in my travel bag. What I brought it and carry it as

00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:05,820
a carry on. Most the time they will pull you aside and they will look at it. When

00:01:05,820 --> 00:01:11,020
they x-ray it, it doesn't look like a bomb but they may think what's this. And

00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:16,120
sometimes they just look at it and just swap it down and let you go and

00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:19,620
sometimes they've asked me what's this and I say it's a right machine and then

00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:24,820
they look at me and they shake their head and they swap it down and give it back to me.

